HAZARD FEEDS INGESTION PATH
===========================
BuiltIn connectors (osint/connector_extra.go):
- builtin-usgs → USGS all_day.geojson, RawText "[earthquake] M x.x | ..."
- builtin-eonet → NASA EONET open events; volcanoes tagged [volcano erupting]
- builtin-volcano → EONET category=volcanoes dedicated feed

Intelligence source registry (intelligence_sources.go):
- usgs-earthquakes adapter usgs_geojson (summary carries [earthquake] M tag)
- eonet-volcanoes adapter eonet_volcano

Frontend boot: silent fetch of builtin-usgs, builtin-volcano, builtin-eonet
after Global Watch init; Settings "Alle Quellen laden" includes same set.

Unit tests:
- intelligence/volcano_parse_test.go
- intelligence/usgs_parse_test.go (existing + summary tag test in volcano_parse_test)
- globe_math_runtime_test.go goja magnitude/volcano/datetime
